From: Kiran Gopinathan <kiran@basis.ai>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 01:00:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat: Paralean mode switch (LEAN_PARALEAN)

Adds `Lean.Paralean.Config`, a process-wide switch for the Paralean fork hooks
(distributed declaration sharing). Every hook is off by default, so a process that
does not set `LEAN_PARALEAN` (or call `Lean.Paralean.setConfig`) behaves as stock
Lean. `Lean.Paralean.apiVersion` lets libraries detect the fork.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
